  "association_rule": "latest_checkpoint_at_or_before_observed_at_utc. The observation keeps its genuine observed_at_utc; the timestamp is never rewritten to the checkpoint clock. Association interval is [checkpoint_utc, next_checkpoint_utc); the last pre-release interval is [T0-5m, T0). Post-T0 observations (observed_at_utc >= T0) are not pre-release and do not capture any pre-release checkpoint. CAPTURED if any qualifying pre-release observation associates to that checkpoint. DUE if now >= checkpoint_utc and now < next_boundary and not CAPTURED. MISSED_NOT_OBSERVED if now >= next_boundary and not CAPTURED. FUTURE if now < checkpoint_utc. Missed is not a zero forecast.",
